  "summary_en": "European Commission Communication setting an action plan on drone and counter-drone security, organised around prepare, detect and respond, plus defence readiness and international cooperation. It proposes tighter registration and identification rules, a trusted drone label, counter-drone certification and testing, and a feasibility study for an EU counter-drone regulatory framework.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Propose a Drone Security Package by Q3 2026 extending registration and remote identification to drones above 100g",
   "Develop an EU Trusted Drone Label by Q4 2026 with third-party verification",
   "Issue a Recommendation on voluntary performance requirements for counter-drone systems; EASA to set safety criteria",
   "Feasibility study for an EU-level counter-drone regulatory framework by 2030",
   "Counter-drone centre of excellence, EU drone incident platform, rapid emergency response teams and Drone Alliance with Ukraine"
